COMPILATION OF: E49J2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49J2

   1 a 0000 E49J2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P4] `^(rec.na < rec.nb)' -- negated STRICT relation,
   4 a 0006      equal extents.  H-D-inv: F1's written-order stacked head
   5 a 0006      (collapse 06 03 / 78) with the JNC d2 skip INVERTED to JC da;
   6 a 0006      H-D-simpl rewrites `< ' to `>= ' -- same head, same da --
   7 a 0006      again non-separable; H-D-extra: an extra branch or helper call
   8 a 0006      distinguishes it. */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  13 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  14 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  15 c 0006   if ^(rec.na < rec.nb) then k = 1;
  16 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  17 c 003F   stop;
  18 a 0042 end E49J2;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
